  "term": "parental rejection",
  "definition": "Parental rejection is the opposite of parental acceptance: a relationship pattern marked by absent or substantially withdrawn parental warmth, affection, care, comfort, concern, nurturance, support, or love, often together with physically or psychologically hurtful behavior.",
